<!--
    Runeskald icons: filled white silhouettes on a 24-unit grid, chunky with square cut ends and diamond pips, the way
    God of War Ragnarok draws its menu and equipment glyphs. Generated by art/icons.py (edit the script, not the lines
    between the ICONS markers). Each Geometry is filled even-odd ("F0"): a polygon inside another punches a hole.
    IconTemplate fills it in the control's Foreground; nothing is stroked.
    Playnite's menu icons keep their icofont glyphs; only their hardcoded colors move onto theme brushes.
-->
